[suggestion] What about reducing `.has()` call like this?

```js
function getCachedRule(ruleName) {
	let rule = ruleCache.get(ruleName);

	if (!rule) {
		rule = import(`./${ruleName}/index.mjs`).then((m) => m.default);
		ruleCache.set(ruleName, rule);
	}

	return rule;
}
```

